	quest.0F0E0CB59AAC993D.quest_desc: [
		"We want you to &5discover&r the game for yourself, but here are a&6 few tips!&r"
		""
		"Hold SHIFT when hovering over an item to &6learn more&r about it."
		""
		"You can access your quests, team, skills, and map from the &5inventory tabs.&r"
		""
		"The right hand side of your inventory shows &6craftable items&r and your search."
		""
		"The left hand side shows your &5favorites&r (press A to favorite)."
		""
		"Press TAB to &6search&r for an item."
		""
		"Open video settings and switch off shaders if you need to &5improve performance.&r"
		""
		"Use the &6quests&r as a guide if you get lost!"
	]
